WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.251
-Guys, today's Friday.

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:02.516
That's usually when I catch up

00:00:02.516 --> 00:00:03.383
with some personal stuff.

00:00:03.383 --> 00:00:04.487
You know, I check my inbox,

00:00:04.487 --> 00:00:05.901
return some emails,
and, of course,

00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:07.133
I send out thank-you notes

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:08.234
And I was running a bit behind.

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:10.167
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:11.634
I thought I could write
some out right now.

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:14.701
Roots, can I get some thank-you
note writing music, please?!

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:15.767
[ Playing tender tune ]

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:19.467
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.968
-Wow.

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:23.734
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:26.901
-Thank you, Ariana Grande
joining "The Voice."

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.300
Although, it was scary
the other night

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.734
when her chair spun
around so fast

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.901
that her ponytail almost
took out John Legend.

00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:34.133
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Whapssh!

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.367
Ksss!

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:39.033
-[ French accent ]
Those bitches.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:42.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.968
You had a bag with baguette
in it, too, didn't you,

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:46.200
when you were doing that?

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.334
I saw the whole thing.
-When I did that,

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.601
I had a striped shirt.
-Yep, beret.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:51.834
-A beret, of course.
-A little mustache.

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:53.033
-Drawn on.
-Yep.

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:55.200
-Drawn-on mustache.
-Yep, cigarette.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.801
-Cigatette.
-And a baguette

00:00:57.801 --> 00:00:59.868
out of your back pocket.
-Yes, and a beret

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:02.067
in the other pocket.
-In case this one
fell off, yeah.

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:04.267
-As a gift for someone.
-I saw that all. Acting.

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:05.634
-You saw that in the acting?
-Yeah.

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:07.033
I saw that.
Just from the movement,

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.901
I could tell.
Ooh!

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.567
Oh, my gosh!
The beret just --

00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:15.033
Wait, are you wearing
a beret, or not?

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.767
Sssss!

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:18.601
You put it out
in a cup of espresso.

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:19.667
-Correct.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:23.567
-Oh, my gosh.
He's got some butter?

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:24.701
Some beurre?

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:27.033
Jam. Ham. Nutella.

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:28.634
[ Laughter ]
What is it?

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:30.467
Peanut butter.
You're French.

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:31.868
Oh, you're spreading something.

00:01:31.868 --> 00:01:34.334
It's French bread.

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:35.467
French fries.

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:37.234
-Brie.
-[ French accent ] Mayonnaise?

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.033
Cheese.
Gruyère cheese?

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:41.901
-Close.
-Brie!

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:44.467
-Guys, guys!

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:45.934
Stop!
-You're a Frenchman.

00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:47.067
You're spreading...

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:48.300
-Dijon.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:52.334
Gosh!

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:54.033
[ Muttering ]

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:57.033
-I feel like a fool.
I feel like a fool.

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:58.534
You're prepping the sandwich.

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:01.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.934 --> 00:02:03.367
-I was correcting the sandwich.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah,

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:04.801
you were just
getting ready to eat.

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:07.067
I thought you were
creating a sandwich.

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:08.601
-I was correcting the sandwich.

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:11.133
-You were correcting it
by putting Dijon.

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:12.167
-I don't work at Subway.

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:14.133
I'm a sandwich corrector.
-Right.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.567
"Hey, that's wrong."
-Thanks.

00:02:16.567 --> 00:02:17.868
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:17.868 --> 00:02:21.901
Thank you, Applebee's new
spooky Halloween cocktails.

00:02:21.901 --> 00:02:23.667
Or as people everywhere put it,
"Uh,

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:25.067
I'm going to have
to do my own research

00:02:25.067 --> 00:02:26.634
before I put that into my body."

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:29.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:35.467
I'm gonna have
to do my own research

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:37.100
before I do that, please.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:41.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.601 --> 00:02:42.667
♪♪

00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:44.734
Thank you, sweater weather,

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:46.067
or, as I like to call it,

00:02:46.067 --> 00:02:46.968
Chris Evans season.

00:02:46.968 --> 00:02:49.968
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.267
-[ Scat sings note ]

00:02:55.267 --> 00:02:56.534
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:58.734
Thank you,
outdoor movie nights,

00:02:58.734 --> 00:03:00.901
for combining the fun
of going to the movies

00:03:00.901 --> 00:03:01.901
with the excitement of getting

00:03:01.901 --> 00:03:03.234
600 mosquito bites.

00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:05.667
[ Laughter and applause ]
-[ Buzz ]

00:03:07.934 --> 00:03:11.267
[ Continues buzzing ]

00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:13.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.133
-Higgins, can you not do that?

00:03:14.133 --> 00:03:15.601
Sounds like a mosquito.

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:16.868
-Oh, I'm sorry.
I have something in my throat.

00:03:16.868 --> 00:03:18.634
-Yeah.
-[ Buzz ]

00:03:18.634 --> 00:03:19.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.634 --> 00:03:20.701
♪♪

00:03:20.701 --> 00:03:23.100
-Thank you, laptop chargers,

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.834
for only ever coming
in two lengths --

00:03:24.834 --> 00:03:27.267
6 inches too short,
or 6 feet too long.

00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:29.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:29.868 --> 00:03:30.934
That's a long charger.

00:03:30.934 --> 00:03:34.667
[ Applause ]

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:35.767
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:03:35.767 --> 00:03:37.834
Thank you, push pins,

00:03:37.834 --> 00:03:39.834
for being thumb tacks
that wear top hats.

00:03:39.834 --> 00:03:40.868
There you have it, everybody.
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:03:40.868 --> 00:03:42.467
Those are my thank-you notes.

